# Private deny-list — NEVER COMMIT THIS FILE.
#
# Copy to tools/private-deny.txt (gitignored) and add one literal per line:
# tenant domains, landline numbers, public/tunnel addresses, hostnames,
# e-mail addresses, certificate names, anything deployment-specific.
#
# The pre-commit hook reads it and refuses to stage any file containing a
# listed value. The deny-list stays local precisely because it holds the
# sensitive values themselves.
#
# Example (placeholders only — replace locally):
# sip.alpha.home.example.net
# 01111111
# 203.0.113.10
